      "id": "58879e17-6906-4827-abf3-7351d86cac98",
      "title": "#6228 fix gap review",
      "body": "Primary client_traffics expiry/enable merge addresses #6228 without breaking #4917 same-expiry latch. Remaining gaps: (1) !dirty still adopts snapIb.Settings wholesale so stale enable=false/old expiry can overwrite master post-extend; (2) SyncInbound path keeps settings-derived clients.enable=false when nodeDisableIsStale (only skips cs.Enable latch); (3) intentional shorten vs longer stale node still loses (pre-existing monotonic adoption); (4) clearing expiry to 0 still loses to positive node expiry."
    },
